      0: TRUE_SMC_LOAD ; Load from anchor a$imm0
      1: TRUE_SMC_LOAD ; Load from anchor b$imm0
      2: r5 = r3 + r4
      3: return r5

Function .home.alice.dev.minz.minzc.benchmarks.c_vs_minz.arithmetic.sub16$u16$u16(a: u16, b: u16) -> u16
  @smc
  Instructions:
